#!/usr/bin/env python3
#
# description: Firewall-log filter script (arno-fwfilter)
# Last update: October 1, 2026 (Python version)

# Usage examples (make sure arno-fwfilter is executable!):
# --------------------------------------------------------
# Static firewall log filtering                         : journalctl -k |grep "kernel: ANF" |arno-fwfilter
# Realtime firewall log filtering                       : journalctl -k -f -g '^(ANF|AIF):' |arno-fwfilter
# Email firewall logs to root                           : journalctl -k |grep "kernel: ANF" |arno-fwfilter --html-output --no-colors |mail -s "Firewall Log" -a "Content-Type: text/html; charset=us-ascii" root

